/T (As AI-generated images, videos, emails, and text become increasingly realistic and widespread online, it is becoming harder for everyday users, especially those unfamiliar with AI, to distinguish between authentic and AI-generated content. This makes people more vulnerable to scams and impersonation. It also spreads misinformation and makes it harder to know what to trust online.)
